Package: zash
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: bash-like shell (pipelines, functions, alias)
 zash reads commands from stdin or runs a single line with -c. It supports
 bash-like syntax including pipelines, functions, alias, and PS1 expansion.
 .
 This package installs the zash binary, manual page, and bash-completion
 script.
